000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    SMREQINQ.
000400 AUTHOR.        C.I.HILLES/J.COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.  MARCH 23, 1984.
000600*INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
000700*
      *****************************************************************
000800*               REQUISITION INQUIRY - MAIN PROGRAM.
000900*               THIS IS THE DRIVING PROGRAM FOR THE REQUISITION
001000*               INQUIRY PROGRAMS.
      *****************************************************************
001100*
001200*     CALLING INSTRUCTIONS:
001300*       CALL "SMREQINQ" USING REQI-RET-CODE, BASE, STATUS-AREA,
001400*         VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS, REQI-DATA, MPLTINFO-COMP,
001500*         PASS-SPOOL-PRT-NO.
001600*
001700*   REQI-RET-CODE       0 WILL BE RETURNED IF SUCCESSFUL. NON-ZERO
001800*                       IF ERROR
001900*
002000*   BASE                BASE NAME FOR "STORES" DATABASE.  MUST BE
002100*                       OPENED
002200*
002300*   STATUS-AREA         STATUS AREA FOR DATA BASE CALLS
002400*
002500*   VIEW-COMAREA        COMM AREA FOR VIEW CALLS
002600*
002700*   LANGUAGE-PARMS      NATIVE LANGUAGE SUPPORT PARAMETERS.  MUST
002800*                       BE SET TO CURRENT LANGUAGE
002900*
003000*   REQI-DATA           REQ NUMBER, WORKORDER NUMBER, OR CORP CODE
003100*                       IS PASSED IF YOU DONT WISH THE FIRST SCREEN.
003200*                       IF ANY OF THESE ARE NON-SPACES, THEN THE
003300*                       PROGRAM WILL GO DIRECTLY TO DISPLAY DATA
003400*                       FOR THAT ENTRY, WITHOUT ASKING THE USER TO
003500*                       ENTER REQ, WO, OR CORP CODE.
003600*
003700*  MPLTINFO-COMP        X(4).  THE PLANT CODE MUST BE PASSED.
003800*
003900*  PASS-SPOOL-PRT-NO    S9(2) COMP-4.THE SCREEN PRINT PRINTER NUMBER
004000*                       MUST BE PASSED.
004100*
004200*           **********************************************
004300*           **  INPUT:  REQUISITION NUMBER  OR          **
004400*           **          WORK ORDER NUMBER  OR           **
004500*           **          MAINTAINANCE REQUISITION NUMBER **
004600*           **********************************************.
004700*
      *C
      *****************************************************************
      **          M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************
      *C   05/05/94  JE COFFMAN  WRITTEN REQUEST 94-001/SLS REQ 6487
      *C     ADDED THE ABILITY TO ALLOW 'SS' STATUS REQUISITIONS
      *C     THAT HAVE THE AUTHORIZATION FLAG SET VIA MP1 TO BE
      *C     HANDLED.
      *C
      *C   11/21/96  CA YODER   REQ #96-027
      *C     ADDED CURRENCY CODE TO APPROVAL SCREEN.
      *C
      *C   12/03/96  CA YODER   REQ #95-025
      *C     ADDED THE OPTION TO ENTER A SEARCH DATE FOR DISPLAYING
      *C     REQUISITIONS.
      *C
      *C   12/01/97  CA YODER
      *C     PROBLEM FOUND WITH OPTIONS 5 & 6 BY Y2K TESTING.  THE
      *C     REQS WERE NOT COMING UP IN THE RIGHT DATE ORDER.  SORT-DATE
      *C     & REQTEMP-DATE NOT EXPANDED FOR CENTURY.  CORRECTED PROBLEM.
      *C
      *C   13FEB1998 WL MCINTYRE  REQ #98-002
      *C     ADD LOGIC TO INCLUDE NEW TAX-CODE FIELD FROM DREQITM
      *C     ON THE REQ APPROVAL SCREEN.
      *C
      *C   20OCT1998 JE COFFMAN
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO PROCESS A Q8 INQUIRY REQUEST BASED ON
      *C     WHETHER THE CALLING PROGRAM HAS PASSED A CLOCK CARD OR
      *C     NOT. NAPANEE NEEDED TO RESTRICT USERS FROM SEEING
      *C     SENSITIVE INFORMATION SO A SYSTEM WAS SETUP TO USE
      *C     THE USERNAME FIELD TO RETRIEVE THE MEMPL CLOCK CARD
      *C     AS WELL AS THE INDICATOR TO TELL WHETHER THE USER HAD
      *C     UNLIMITED ACCESS OR COULD ONLY VIEW REQS THAT HE/SHE
      *C     HAD ORIGINATED.
      *C
      *C   21OCT1998 JE COFFMAN
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO SEND A DISPLAY MESSAGE BACK TO THE USER
      *C     IF NO REQUISITIONS WERE AVAILABLE FOR THEM AS THE
      *C     ORIGINATOR.
      *C
      *C   02/01/01   JE COFFMAN (GADSDEN REQUEST)
      *C     ADD LOGIC AND CHANGE FUNCTION KEYS SO THAT F5 COULD
      *C     BE USED TO EXECUTE A CALL TO PXBVA006 (THE CHECKBOOK)
      *C     ROUTINES WHENEVER AN APPROVER WAS DETERMINING WHETHER
      *C     TO APPROVE A REQUISITION OR NOT.
      *C
      *C   02/08/02   BE GEISER
      *C     MOVE TAX CODE UPDATE LOGIC BEFORE APPROVE AND REPRINT
      *C     FUNCTIONS. UPDATED TAX CODES WERE NOT PRINTING ON REQS.
      *C     ALLOW TAX CODE CHANGE AND EDIT WITHOUT PRESSING F8 TO
      *C     APPROVE THE REQ.
      *C
      *C   04/23/02   CA YODER
      *C     FOR R3 PLANTS, SHOW "SAP INT ORDER #" LITERAL INSTEAD OF
      *C     "ADDITIONAL INFO."  ALSO ALLOW EDITING OF THIS FIELD
      *C     WITH VALIDATION AGAINST MVALIDPLTDATA DATASET.
      *C
      *C   08/06/02   CA YODER   LAWTON REQUEST
      *C     ADDED NEW SORT OPTION TO ALLOW SORT BY QUEUE DATE FOR
      *C     INQUIRIES BY APPROVER.
      *C
      *C   04/22/03   CA YODER   NAPANEE REQUEST
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO MOVE SPACES TO ORIGINATOR NAME IF THE
      *C     ORIGINATOR IS BLANK.  THE NAME ON PRIOR SCREEN WAS
      *C     BEING CARRIED OVER IF NO ORIGINATOR WAS PRESENT.
      *C
      *C   07/21/04   GEISER     GADSDEN REQUEST
      *C     ADDED REQ TYPE (MATERIAL/SERVICE/REPAIR) TO DISPLAY SCREEN.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
DCR01 *C MAR 10, 2005  D.RAUCH       DCR01    REQUEST# 2005-78515
DCR01 *C    DISPLAY FILE PROCESSING CHANGED FROM USING ZCSISINQ
DCR01 *C    NEW DISPLAY FILE ZSMREQINQ CREATED - FORMATS COPIED
DCR01 *C    FROM ZCSISINQ.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 3/21/2005    CA YODER       REQ #2005-45728
      *C    FOR SAP PLANTS, SHOW CODE DESCRIPTION FOR CODED REQS
      *C    IN ADDITION TO REQ DESCRIPTION LINES.
DCR01 *****************************************************************

