048600 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING          REQI-RET-CODE,
048700                                   BASE,
048800                                   BASE-STHIST,
048900                                   BASE-MMISA,
049000                                   BASE-BUDGET,
049100                                   STATUS-AREA,
