      *------ SET UP FKEY LINE AND SET TO OVERRIDE DEFAULT IN FORMFILE
      *------ AND POSITION CURSOR TO THE APPROVAL STATUS FIELD
           IF SAVE-INQ-INQ-FLAG = "N"
               MOVE SPACES        TO CLW-7
               MOVE "I"           TO SRF-FKEY (7)
           ELSE
           MOVE "F7-NEW INQ"      TO CLW-7.
