181900******************************************************************
182000**                                                              **
182100**    L O A D   F R O M   D R E Q Q U E                         **
182200**                                                              **
182300******************************************************************
182400 6500-LOAD-FROM-DREQQUE.
182500*------ THERE ARE 4 KEYS INTO THE DREQQUE DATASET:
182600*------   1. MEMPL:  QUEUED EMPLOYEE (ALL ENTRIES)
182700*------   2. AEMPL:  ORIGINATING EMPLOYEE (ALL ENTRIES)
182800*------   3. AEMPLQST:  QUEUED EMPLOYEE + REQ-RELEASE STAT
182900*------   4. AEMPLOST:  ORIGINATING EMPLOYEE + REQ-RELEASE STAT
183000*------ WITH THE KEY + RELEASE STAT, THE CHAINS ARE DIVIDED INTO
183100*------ 3 GROUPS BY STATUS ('empl  ', 'emplX ') FOR FASTER ACCESS
183200*------ (ESPECIALLY FOR REQ APPROVERS). NOTE: FOR 'XX' STATUS, WE
183300*------ HAVE TO GO TO THE LONG CHAIN: TOOK TO LONG TO DELETE/PUT
183400*------ ALL DREQQUE ENTRIES ON PO ITEM CREATION.
183500     IF SELECT-KEY-FLAG = "O"
183600         IF DE-HOLD-ONLY > " "
183700             MOVE ORIG-SEARCH-ST   TO   ORIG-OR-EMPL-SEARCH
183800             MOVE DE-ORIGINATOR    TO   EMPL-ARG-WORK-EMPL
183900             MOVE "  "             TO   EMPL-ARG-WORK-ST
184000             MOVE EMPL-ARG-WORK    TO   EMPL-ARG
184100         ELSE
184200         IF DE-INCLUDE-IN-PURCH = "X"
184300         AND DE-INCLUDE-ON-PO = SPACES
184400         AND DE-INCLUDE-UNAPPROVED = SPACES
184500             MOVE ORIG-SEARCH-ST   TO   ORIG-OR-EMPL-SEARCH
184600             MOVE DE-ORIGINATOR    TO   EMPL-ARG-WORK-EMPL
184700             MOVE "X "             TO   EMPL-ARG-WORK-ST
184800             MOVE EMPL-ARG-WORK    TO   EMPL-ARG
184900         ELSE
185000         IF DE-INCLUDE-UNAPPROVED = "X"
185100         AND DE-INCLUDE-ON-PO = SPACES
185200         AND DE-INCLUDE-IN-PURCH = SPACES
185300             MOVE ORIG-SEARCH-ST   TO   ORIG-OR-EMPL-SEARCH
185400             MOVE DE-ORIGINATOR    TO   EMPL-ARG-WORK-EMPL
185500             MOVE "  "             TO   EMPL-ARG-WORK-ST
185600             MOVE EMPL-ARG-WORK    TO   EMPL-ARG
185700         ELSE
185800             MOVE ORIG-SEARCH      TO   ORIG-OR-EMPL-SEARCH
185900             MOVE DE-ORIGINATOR    TO   EMPL-ARG
186000     ELSE
186100         IF DE-INCLUDE-IN-PURCH = "X"
186200         AND DE-INCLUDE-ON-PO = SPACES
186300         AND DE-INCLUDE-UNAPPROVED = SPACES
186400             MOVE QUEUED-SEARCH-ST TO   ORIG-OR-EMPL-SEARCH
186500             MOVE DE-APPROVER      TO   EMPL-ARG-WORK-EMPL
186600             MOVE "X "             TO   EMPL-ARG-WORK-ST
186700             MOVE EMPL-ARG-WORK    TO   EMPL-ARG
186800         ELSE
186900         IF DE-INCLUDE-UNAPPROVED = "X"
187000         AND DE-INCLUDE-ON-PO = SPACES
187100         AND DE-INCLUDE-IN-PURCH = SPACES
187200             MOVE QUEUED-SEARCH-ST TO   ORIG-OR-EMPL-SEARCH
187300             MOVE DE-APPROVER      TO   EMPL-ARG-WORK-EMPL
187400             MOVE "  "             TO   EMPL-ARG-WORK-ST
187500             MOVE EMPL-ARG-WORK    TO   EMPL-ARG
187600         ELSE
187700             MOVE EMPL-SEARCH      TO   ORIG-OR-EMPL-SEARCH
187800             MOVE DE-APPROVER      TO   EMPL-ARG.
187900
188000*    CALL "DBFIND" USING BASE, DSET-DREQQUE, MODE1, STATUS-AREA,
188100*      ORIG-OR-EMPL-SEARCH, EMPL-ARG.
           PERFORM 9000-DBFIND-DREQQUE.
188200     IF NO-ENTRY
188300*        "N113: NO REQUISITIONS EXIST FOR THIS EMPLOYEE"
188400         MOVE  14 TO LANG-SETNUM
188500         MOVE 113 TO LANG-MSGNUM
188600         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
188700     ELSE
188800     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
188900         MOVE "DBFIND ERR DREQQUE 6590-LFD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
189000         PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
189100
189200 6510-LOAD-FROM-DREQQUE-LOOP.
189300*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-DREQQUE, MODE5,
189400*      STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-DREQQUE, CODE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9010-DBGET-DREQQUE.
189500     IF END-OF-CHAIN
189600         GO TO 6590-LFD-X
189700     ELSE
189800     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
189900         MOVE "DBGET ERR DREQQUE 6510-LFDL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
190000         PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
190100
190200     MOVE DRQQ-REQ-NUMBER          TO   REQ-ARG.
190300     PERFORM 7030-GET-MREQ.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               GO TO 6510-LOAD-FROM-DREQQUE-LOOP.
190400     PERFORM 7020-FIND-GET-DREQD THRU 7025-FGD-X.
190500     IF DRQQ-QUEUED-DATE-CN = SPACES
190600         MOVE "N"                  TO   EAEDIT-QUEUED-FLAG
190700     ELSE
190800         MOVE "Y"                  TO   EAEDIT-QUEUED-FLAG.
190900     PERFORM 7120-CHECK-SELECTIONS THRU 7140-CS-X.
191000     IF SELECTED-FLAG = "N"
191100         GO TO 6510-LOAD-FROM-DREQQUE-LOOP.
191200
191300     PERFORM 7150-WRITE-REQTEMP.
191400     GO TO 6510-LOAD-FROM-DREQQUE-LOOP.
191500
191600 6590-LFD-X.
191700     EXIT.
191800
