208400 7050-FIND-GET-DREQQUE.
208500*------ A REQ COULD BE QUEUED TO AN EMPL MORE THAN ONCE, DUE
208600*------ TO ALTERNATES. IF QUEUED TO HIM AT ONE LEVEL, IT MIGHT
208700*------ NOT BE QUEUED TO HIM AT THE NEXT.  THEREFORE, IF WE FIND
208800*------ IT QUEUED TO HIM AT ONE LEVEL, WE SEARCH ON FOR
208900*------ A LEVEL WHERE HE DIDNT APPROVE IT.  IF WE DONT FIND
209000*------ THAT WE GO BACK TO THE PREVIOUS LEVEL WE FOUND HE APPROVED
209100*------ IT AT.
           MOVE SPACES TO SAVE-ORDER.
209300     MOVE "N"                      TO   EAEDIT-QUEUED-FLAG.
209400*    CALL "DBFIND" USING BASE, DSET-DREQQUE, MODE1, STATUS-AREA,
209500*      REQ-SEARCH, REQ-ARG.
