214500*------ IF INQUIRING BY ORIGINATOR, THERE ARE MULTIPLE ENTRIES IN
214600*------ THE QUEUE DATASET FOR EACH REQ BY THAT ORIGINATOR (1 FOR
214700*------ EACH REQUIRED APPROVAL FOR THAT REQ).  HOWEVER THE FIRST
214800*------ ONE FOR EACH REQ IS FLAGGED.  LOOK AT ONLY 1ST ONE.
