215400*------ THAT HAVE NOT YET QUEUED TO THAT APPROVER: THE QUEUED
215500*------ DATE IS SPACES. ALSO, WE DONT WANT TO SEE REQS ORIGINATED
215600*------ BY THAT APPROVER.
